  partName: Left Front Clip
  description: The Left Front Clip is a tiny, complex-shaped component located at
    the top-left-front of the engine, made of Material.001, which functions as a
    retaining device for various engine components, such as hoses or wires. Its small
    size and strategic placement allow it to keep critical components securely in
    place, even under intense engine vibration. Interestingly, the Left Front Clip's
    complex shape enables it to accommodate different component sizes and shapes.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
